/*
  SecurityStatusWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0085 · SecurityStatusWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SecurityStatusWidget` resolves (table "SecurityStatusWidget") lives here with
  its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/SecurityStatusWidget.tsx) — the shell title, the
  four status-cell labels/values, and the grid empty message. The remaining keys
  back the native-only chrome (registry description, freshness chip, refresh/
  retry/empty/error copy, and accessibility).
*/

